Package: USBCamera
Type: Package
Title: Robust USB Camera Viewfinder, Control, and Pixel Analysis for Shiny
Version: 0.2.1
Author: Jay Warrick [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jay Warrick <jay.warrick@gmail.com>
Description: High-reliability WebRTC-powered USB camera streaming, orientation calibration, 
    viewfinder reticles, pixel-accurate overlays, and frame capture for Shiny applications. 
    Includes automatic device enumeration, 400ms bus cooldowns for USB controllers (Cypress FX3, 
    Dino-Lite, UVC), stream recovery, and direct conversion to EBImage arrays for downstream 
    computer vision and quantitative image processing.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports:
    shiny (>= 1.7.0),
    htmltools (>= 0.5.0),
    jsonlite (>= 1.8.0),
    base64enc (>= 0.1-3)
Suggests:
    EBImage,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
URL: https://github.com/SalusDiscovery/R-Package-USBCamera
BugReports: https://github.com/SalusDiscovery/R-Package-USBCamera/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
